{"4761490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moose Migration", "steam_appid": 4761490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moose Migration</strong> is a story-driven adventure following the annual spring migration of a Nordic moose. Every year, moose leave the deep winter forests behind and journey to fresh spring grazing grounds. <strong>Now it's your turn to make that journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your karma. Help wildlife and protect the forest, or tear down human structures to reclaim the wild. Harm the wilderness, and karma and the forest itself will turn against you. <strong>The kind of moose you become is up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Will you be a peaceful wanderer, a curious explorer, a guardian of the wild, or a force of chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more you're moosin', the more they'll find out.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moose Migration</strong> is a story-driven adventure following the annual spring migration of a Nordic moose. Every year, moose leave the deep winter forests behind and journey to fresh spring grazing grounds. <strong>Now it's your turn to make that journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your karma. Help wildlife and protect the forest, or tear down human structures to reclaim the wild. Harm the wilderness, and karma and the forest itself will turn against you. <strong>The kind of moose you become is up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Will you be a peaceful wanderer, a curious explorer, a guardian of the wild, or a force of chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more you're moosin', the more they'll find out.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Moose Migra